WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.517
In place of experiments,

00:00:01.597 --> 00:00:06.772
the paper studies how the convergence rate depends
on the momentum coefficient.

00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:09.366
At zero it recovers SGD's rate exactly;

00:00:09.446 --> 00:00:15.420
toward one it shrinks the coefficient and pushes
the time-average rate to order one over T.
